<title>THAILAND: One Holding says sells Securities One sta.</title>
<headline>One Holding says sells Securities One sta.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Troubled Thai trading firm One Holding Plc will auction 6,774,532 million shares of broker Securities One Plc on Tuesday, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Banque Indosuez is acting as auctioneer.</p>
<p>One Holding defaulted on a $13.5 million debt payment in March and urgently needs funds to pay off looming liabilities. Securities One Plc is one of Thailand's leading securities companies.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642, bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
</text>
